      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A patient is presented with ischemic heart disease and mitral regurgitation; the patient's pulmonary artery wedge \"V\" waves and left ventricular end diastolic pressure decreased during exercise. Possible explanations for this unusual hemodynamic response are discussed."},
